        {
          "text": "Aba bonse bali bana bakwa Asheri, intungulushi sha mayanda ya bashibo abaume abasalwa, impalume shabulwi kabili intungulushi ishacine. Abaume abengalwa inkondo, abapendelwe ukulingana no butantiko bwa kufyalwa kwabo bali amakana amakumi yabili na mutanda (26,000).",
